values ((select id from public.content_sources where source_url = 'yuny://authored/en/v1'), 'authored-ordering-dinner-for-two', 'chapter', 'Ordering dinner for two', 0, '[{"type":"paragraph","text":"On Friday Maya wants to eat out with her friend Tom. In the morning she calls a small restaurant near her house. She asks them to book a table for two people at seven."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"They arrive on time. A waiter meets them at the door and shows them a table by the window. He gives them the menu and a glass of water."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Maya opens the menu and reads it slowly. The starters are on the first page: small dishes for the beginning. Then come the main courses, the big dishes in the middle. The desserts are at the end."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Next to the chicken she sees rice and salad. Rice is not a whole meal. It is a side dish, and it comes with the main course."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"At the top of the menu there is one dish in a box. It is the daily special, and the cook makes it only today."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tom does not know what to choose. He asks the waiter to recommend something. The waiter says the soup is very good today. Tom is allergic to fish, so he asks about the soup first. There is no fish in it."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Now they are ready to order. Maya says she would like the daily special. Tom orders the soup and then the chicken with rice. The waiter writes the order down and takes the menu away."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"The food comes ten minutes later. They eat slowly and talk about their week. For dessert they both take ice cream."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"At the end of the meal Maya asks the waiter for the bill. He brings it on a small plate. It is forty euros for the two of them. They split the bill, so each friend pays twenty euros."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tom has no cash in his pocket today. He asks if he can pay by card. Maya pays her half in cash. Before they leave, she puts a small tip on the table for the kind waiter."}]'::jsonb, now(), 325, 'parsed', 'A2'::public.cefr_level, 'at-a-restaurant-a2-ordering-01')
